Package: oocpuinfo
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: CPU CAPABILITIES
 Decodes CPU microarchitecture, flags (AVX512, AES, etc.), cache sizes, and bugs.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
